  "html": "<p>77 (Luna Corporate / Tobacco Concept Factory, Poland) runs the most disciplined range in the category: one strength — 10.4mg per pouch (16mg/g) — one slim format, 20 pouches per can, and a flavour list that runs past fifteen entries at retail. Strength is a settled question with this brand; flavour is the entire decision. Here is every flavour from our research files, rated in a line each, grouped by family.</p><p><em>(A labelling note that applies to everything below: 77 calls 10.4mg \"Medium\" on its own 3/5 dot scale; most retailers class it extra strong. It's the same pouch either way — trust the number.)</em></p><h2>The cola family</h2><p><strong><a href=\"/product/77-cola-medium\">77 Cola</a></strong> ★★★★ — Zingy, tingling, complete: acidity, caramel and freshness in proper cola proportion. The family reference. <strong><a href=\"/product/77-cola-cherry-medium\">77 Cola Cherry</a></strong> ★★★★½ — The best of the trio: real dark-cherry fruit blooming through effervescent cola, never sticky. <strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+cola+vanilla+medium\">77 Cola Vanilla</a></strong> ★★★★ — Cream-soda smoothness; the vanilla counterweights the strength so well it drinks like a lighter pouch.</p><h2>The fruit family</h2><p><strong><a href=\"/product/77-apple-mint-medium\">77 Apple Mint</a></strong> ★★★★ — Succulent orchard apple with a cooling crisp mint sweep — a chilled Granny Smith, not candy. <strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+watermelon+ice+medium\">77 Watermelon Ice</a></strong> ★★★½ — Bright, true-to-fruit watermelon with a late-arriving chill; summer in slim format. <strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+tropical+mint+medium\">77 Tropical Mint</a></strong> ★★★★ — Soft mango and exotic fruit with a crisp mint finish; the fruit stays in charge throughout.</p><h2>The berry family</h2><p><strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+blueberry+medium\">77 Blueberry</a></strong> ★★★★ — Sweet-tart like the actual berry, with a clean frosty edge; the everyday berry. <strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+black+currant+medium\">77 Black Currant</a></strong> ★★★★½ — Sweet and sour in the same breath, like fruit off the bush — plus the best origin story on the shelf (America banned the berry for a century). <strong><a href=\"/product/77-arctic-berry-medium\">77 Arctic Berry VB Edition</a></strong> ★★★★ — Nordic forest berries, clean cooling, and the Valtteri Bottas F1 collaboration can — the collector's pick.</p><h2>The dessert</h2><p><strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+salted+caramel+medium\">77 Salted Caramel</a></strong> ★★★★ — Creamy, buttery, toasted-sugar caramel lifted by a refined sea-salt finish; sweet with sophistication, never cloying.</p><h2>The tobacco (that isn't)</h2><p><strong><a href=\"/search?q=77+classic+tobacco+medium\">77 Classic Tobacco</a></strong> ★★★★ — Rich, spicy tobacco character with zero tobacco content (it ships as \"Vanilla Tobacco\" on the brand's own site); the most convincing bridge for traditional snus users in the all-white category.</p><h2>The range beyond</h2><p>Retailer catalogues list 77's full range at fifteen-plus flavours in the single format — the eleven above are the ones our competitor research has verified in depth, and they map the brand's whole personality: bold flavours, medical-grade nicotine, food-grade flavourings, and absolute consistency of strength. Pick any two families and you'll understand why the one-strength strategy works — rotation without recalibration.</p><p><strong>Related reading:</strong> <a href=\"/blog/77-vs-cuba\">77 vs CUBA</a> · <a href=\"/blog/cola-nicotine-pouches-guide\">Cola Pouches Guide</a> · <a href=\"/blog/best-berry-nicotine-pouches-uk-2025\">Best Berry Pouches</a></p>",
